# Consolidation of SLH-D-0002

Written by Alice, the observer, on 2026-11-23. Bob, Carol and Dave have each
reported "Finished: yes". This document closes the discussion. Nothing is
committed. The renames are staged by `git mv`, and nothing else is staged.

